    .string "="
.L15511:
    .string "operator"
.L15512:
    .string "(= a b)"
.L15513:
    .string "Equality: numbers, Bools, string contents, and ADTs structurally (a generated `T.==`). `<` on an ADT is a type error; use `Ord.compare`."
